@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Rider" as RD
participant "Browser Tab" as UI
participant "AI Chat Service" as Backend
participant "DB: Platform-DB" as DB
participant "LLM Service" as AI

== Transient Session & Context (FR-RD-05.6, AI-RD-09) ==

note over UI, Backend: FR-RD-05.6: Conversation history is maintained\nonly in the active browser tab.
RD -> UI: Send Message ("Change my preferred vehicle to Auto")
activate UI
UI -> Backend: processChatMessage(SessionHistory, Message)
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: getRiderPreferences(RiderID)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: CurrentPreferences
deactivate DB

note over Backend, AI: AI-RD-02, AI-RD-10: Only allowlisted tools exposed.\nOnly public/permitted data sent.
Backend -> AI: generateResponse(Message, ToolsList, CurrentPreferences)
activate AI

== Tool Execution & Guardrails (FR-RD-05.3, AI-RD-05) ==

alt [AI attempts Prohibited Action (e.g., Join Ride)]
    note over AI, Backend: AI-RD-05: No transactional tools exist. AI must reply with UI link.
    AI --> Backend: TextReply ("I cannot join rides. Click here to view ride.")
    Backend --> UI: Message (TextReply)
    UI --> RD: Display message with link
    
else [AI calls propose_preference_update tool]
    AI --> Backend: ToolCall(propose_preference_update, "vehicle=auto")
    deactivate AI
    
    note over Backend, DB: FR-RD-05.3 / AI-RD-04: Proposal requires explicit Rider confirmation
    Backend -> DB: storeProposal(RiderID, "vehicle=auto", Expiry="10 minutes")
    activate DB
    DB --> Backend: ProposalID
    deactivate DB
    
    Backend --> UI: Message (Proposal Pending)
    UI --> RD: Prompt "Confirm changing preferred vehicle to Auto?"
    
    alt [Rider Confirms within 10 minutes]
        RD -> UI: Confirm Proposal
        UI -> Backend: confirmProposal(ProposalID)
        
        group #EBF5FF Atomic Transaction
            Backend -> DB: updatePreferences(RiderID, "vehicle=auto")
            activate DB
            Backend -> DB: markProposalExecuted(ProposalID)
            DB --> Backend: transaction OK
            deactivate DB
        end
        
        Backend --> UI: Message (Preferences Updated)
        UI --> RD: Display "Preferences updated successfully"
        
    else [Rider Declines OR 10 minutes elapse]
        note over UI, Backend: FR-RD-05.3: Unconfirmed proposal lapses after 10 minutes
        RD -> UI: Decline or Ignore
        UI -> Backend: discardProposal(ProposalID)
        
        Backend -> DB: deleteProposal(ProposalID)
        activate DB
        DB --> Backend: delete OK
        deactivate DB
    end
end

note over Backend, DB: AI-RD-12: Record AI Trace (Model, Tokens, Tools) for 90 days (P-28)
Backend -> DB: logAITrace(PseudonymousID, ToolCalls, Tokens)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: log OK
deactivate DB

deactivate Backend
deactivate UI
@enduml